{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_002_1000_p", "source_sha256": "dfcee9695e964b176e6306565be9128ce564191ba006d1f02e77c83de0675b89", "ja": "（39プロジェクトの開始に合わせて、\n真も新しく写真を撮り直すことになった）", "zh": "（为了配合39PROJECT的开始，\n真的宣传照也要重拍。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_002_1001_006mak", "source_sha256": "e6aeffeadc2f6173d16d03d4a4856aea83d8141d61a1e506e7ef7c8617cb95c8", "ja": "{$P$}、おっはようございまーす！", "zh": "{$P$}，早安──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_002_1002_p", "source_sha256": "6a5912d0edf36cac3931fc0057e1cd7bccb826d420fa94fdba20704c7aaae6fc", "ja": "おはよう、真。朝からテンション高いな。", "zh": "早啊，真。你一早就很有活力呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_002_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "967b64f04a2d8b0f5294b7a69a48ce461cd7f0cdb49b8327be7da1a42f5b3e85", "ja": "高くなるのも当たり前ですよ！　なんてったって、\n久しぶりの宣材写真の撮影ですからね～。", "zh": "有活力是当然的啊！毕竟今天，\n可是久违的宣传照拍摄呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_002_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "6e107149df615cb0444650fbacfeff9a7e9effe01f11c766a9fcfc986c097995", "ja": "昔とはひと味もふた味も違う、\n今のボクをばっちり撮ってもらうんですっ！", "zh": "现在的在下已经和过去截然不同，\n要让摄影师好好拍下来才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_002_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "51e29bcc0854cdb9b9de86da4af021fa70f29cc53f30958c720707753df23f91", "ja": "さあ、スーツでもなんでもどんっと来いっ！\nイタリア風でもイギリス風でも着こなしてみせますよ！", "zh": "来吧，不管是西装还是什么都放马过来！\n管他是义式还是英伦风都难不倒在下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_002_1006_p", "source_sha256": "817a0e48017b30652b16981b42f2a2c2bf9c655321770a88209205c7da7a9140", "ja": "おお、頼もしいな。でも、真から\nそういうこと言いだすなんて、なにかあったのか？", "zh": "喔喔，真是可靠。不过，\n真居然会主动说这种话，是发生了什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_002_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "d33f5eec1f40f1d8588f3e9eeacccc765a38538a14c83df91e525a47ca77f335", "ja": "別に何もないですよ？　ただ、ファンのみんなの期待に\n応えるのがプロってモノですから。へへっ♪", "zh": "什么事都没发生呀，只是，能够回应粉丝期待的人\n才称得上是专业的偶像，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_002_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "1ee5bb3f02c6bb2c845771d4dba99b781f6af83e12c4c26ed6283332a1e4b035", "ja": "それに、わかる人にはわかるっていうか～。", "zh": "而且，懂的人自然会懂～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_002_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "ad0e74c39b20ab027a907c6aa42b543a94280ea89bc2de5beec3a08ab39b2bc1", "ja": "ボクのことをカワイイって言ってくれるファンも、\nちゃんといるんです！　少ないですけど。", "zh": "也是有粉丝会称赞在下可爱的！\n虽然人数不多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_002_1010_p", "source_sha256": "e4fd0ea1b74d9bb3d9addd10a04ceb87824e9f455c055e92f4c0cc092897eb66", "ja": "（これまでの色々な出来事が、\n真の中で着実に経験になっているみたいだな……）", "zh": "（看来至今为止发生过的种种，\n确实成了真的养分……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_002_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "148d31c8dab8f8ecfab7e55e500de6bc9f1704b6b4f20289bf3cea4fb5e54651", "ja": "それで、{$P$}。\n今日の衣装はどこにあるんです？", "zh": "那么，{$P$}，\n今天的服装在哪里啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_002_1012_p", "source_sha256": "4fb77bbef9d3de1a2290207cda3580d8952818e0f5141f44bbabbb769fe2fd8d", "ja": "ここに用意してあるよ。\nただ、ちょっと誤解があったみたいだけど。", "zh": "已经准备好放在这了。\n不过，你好像有点误会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_002_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "ffe0b26fd999107640f3026133d198c1cb8ec23ad51bca03e7cd3804827db826", "ja": "誤解？　あの～、どういう事です？", "zh": "误会？请问～你是指什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_002_1014_p", "source_sha256": "6a683cb7cc686a561525008e972a42f1b6fefa8cd786c5fd14cb684896a3d9ba", "ja": "実は、真に着てもらおうと思ってる衣装は…………", "zh": "其实，我想让真穿的服装是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_002_1015", "source_sha256": "532d19d45f49a9931fc03456876ba896025848bddb8cc00d4027fc238e00947a", "ja": "ワンピース", "zh": "洋装", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_002_2000_p", "source_sha256": "db783b6c0d4a8617cfee5399bb9391629fc6a40312363d63fe9490b9e2bc250d", "ja": "このワンピースなんだ。", "zh": "这件洋装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_002_2001_006mak", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_002_2002_006mak", "source_sha256": "2536fefffb6d99f37098245f9a615f61828791be05e98e1473a9165e620850e5", "ja": "ワ……ンピ…………。", "zh": "洋……装…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_002_2003_006mak", "source_sha256": "4805ec2c066d590fcfacc37beb65dfbc45ed018446cc608801ffccdb564bc8ab", "ja": "うわあああぁ～！？　真っ白なワンピースだ！\nす、すごいっ……スカートじゃないですか！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊～！？是纯白的洋装！\n好、好棒……这不是裙子吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_002_2004_p", "source_sha256": "4a5a3060e98e7fa04e1a451dc1812a2624d9372702cf1246f07b4e69716b19fc", "ja": "はは、驚きすぎじゃないか？\nそんなに珍しくないだろう。", "zh": "哈哈，你也太夸张了。\n这没那么稀奇吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_002_2005_006mak", "source_sha256": "9d471ae1dc4bfa8a86b0168d2d7e813a013e2222a7e94405473bc505a31b1eaa", "ja": "だ、だって……本当にいいんですか？\n今日撮るのって、ボクの宣材写真なんですよね？", "zh": "因、因为……在下真的可以穿它吗？\n今天要拍的，确定是在下的宣传照吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_002_2006_p", "source_sha256": "64f93e6435f086e373d6ef3aeb70cbad8a6caec160f6d07492c5bd5c120fe400", "ja": "もちろん。新しい宣材だからこそ、\n真の新しい魅力を見せたいと思って。", "zh": "当然，正因为要做新的宣传，\n所以我想将真的全新魅力展现给大家看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_002_2008_006mak", "source_sha256": "2fa7f8a8283a1586a1acf28af6927feddf770198d8a66206516751c2f1db07cf", "ja": "ありがとうございますっ！　なんていうか、\nボク……嬉しいです！　早速、着替えてきますね！", "zh": "真是太感谢你了！该怎么说，\n在下……真的好开心！在下马上去换衣服！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_002_2009_006mak", "source_sha256": "337df2bca8767799fa0c35bb06824acdd7a855e1724b01837d8a9961789e5451", "ja": "スカート♪　スカート♪　ボクの宣材スカート～♪", "zh": "裙子♪裙子♪在下的宣传裙子～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_002_2010_p", "source_sha256": "fcfe01ec7d2def6866421bd965ee25b52ef316a92e97fb6bd398571e313214b8", "ja": "（純白のワンピースをひらひらとさせながら、\n真は鼻歌交じりに駆けだして行く）", "zh": "（真挥舞着纯白色的洋装，\n哼着歌跑走了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_002_2011_p", "source_sha256": "c5a1b9894120412c5423bfca6545882134c12f0f2c2b7f342ca9d29ba1ac0d8c", "ja": "（その、花が咲いたような笑顔なら、\nきっといままでで一番の写真が撮れるだろう）", "zh": "（看她笑得像朵盛开的花，\n等会一定能拍到比以往都还棒的照片。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
